== General Information ==

This "Task" is required to unlock the Kerran race as a primary race within EQ Legends.  The Task consists of completing multiple smaller quests for various Kerrans around Kerra Isle

Do note that Erudites start off KoS to Kerrans and will need to work on factions or use low level illusions to do this Task

=== Sub-Quests to Complete ===

{{CheckboxList}}
* Aid [[Allix]] on Kerra Isle: '[[The Luck of Allix]]'
* Aid [[Errrak Thickshank]] on Kerra Isle:'[[Health Potion]]'
* Aid [[Feren]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Razortooth]]'
* Aid [[Feskr Drinkmaker]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Feskr's Supplies]]'
* Aid [[Kerran tseq]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Heretic's Toy]]'
* Aid [[Roary Fishpouncer]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Fish Dinner]]'
* Aid [[Shazda Asad]] on Kerra Isle: '[[First Test of Kejaar]]' & '[[Second Test of Kejaar]]'
* Aid [[Thalith Mamluk]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Fang Tooth (quest)]]'
* Aid [[The Kerran Sha`rr]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Something is Wrrrong]]' & '[[This Means Warrr]]'
* Aid [[Urkath Greyface]] on Kerra Isle: '[[Skunk Scent Gland (quest)]]'

=== Details ===
Task: Fang Tooth
* Kill 2 wharf rats in Kerra Isle
* Kill Fang Tooth
* Collect 1 Sharp Tooth(s)
* Give Thalith the Tooth

Task: Feskr's Supplies
* Aquire a Backpack
* Loot Kerran Fish Oil
* Loot a Fire Beetle Leg
* Deliver the components to Feskr Drinkmaker

Task: First Test of Kejaar
* Claim the head of the Erudin Emissary in Toxxulia Forest
* Deliver Emissary Head to Shazda
** Grants follow-up Quest (Second Test of Kejaar)

Task: Second Test of Kejaar
* Claim the head of Sentinel Creot in Toxxulia Forest
* Deliver the head of Sentinel Creot to Shazda

Task: Fish Dinner
* Collect 1 Raw Darkwater Piranha(s)
* Deliver the piranha meat to Roary

Task: Health Potion
* Collect 1 Tiger Skin(s)
* Collect 1 Odd Kobold Paw(s)
* Collect 1 Snake Fang(s)
* Deliver the ingredients to Errrak

Task: Heretic's Toy
* Smash a heretic's pet and gather up the remains
* Deliver the heretic's toy to the kerran tseq

Task: Razortooth
* Kill Razortooth, the meanest fish in Kerra Isle
* Collect Razortooth's remains
* Collect 3 Scrrrumptious Fish Meat
* Deliver the remains of Razortooth, along with 3 [[Scrrrumptious Fish Meat]], to Feren in Kerra Isle.

Task: Skunk Scent Gland
* Acquire a Skunk Scent Gland. Many of these creatures can be found in Toxxulia Forest
* Deliver gland to Ulkath

Task: Somethng is Wrrrong
* Search the north side of the island for clues
* Deliver the Desecrated Kejaar Totem to The Kerran Sha`rr
** Grants follow-up Quest (This Means Warrr)

Task: This Means Warrr
* Slay one of the Heretics at the Tiger Training Pits and collect their orders.
* Show the Heretics orders to The Kerran Sha`rr

Task: The Luck of Allix
* Collect 1 [[Ajrah Leaf]](s)
* Deliver the [[Ajrah Leaf]] to Allix